    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Anvil of Refuge.</strong> Any place you set up your tools becomes just a little harder to hurt people in.</p><ul><li>When you lead the setup of a camp, safehouse, or field workshop, you can declare it an <strong>Anvil of Refuge</strong> for that rest period.</li><li>Creatures who complete a Soma Break there gain a +1 bonus to <strong>defense check against being Shaken</strong> until their next rest.</li><li>At the GM’s discretion, this location may also count as mildly <strong>protective</strong> against certain environmental or metaphysical hazards while the camp lasts.</li></ul>",
